message: "If you use pkpdbib, please cite it as below."
title: "pkpdbib: python utilities for PK/PD literature and bibliography management"
abstract: "pkpdbib is a collection of python utilities for working with pharmacokinetics/pharmacodynamics (PK/PD) literature and bibliographies: retrieval of the PDFs of a Zotero export and programmatic access to Zotero libraries."
type: software
authors:
